    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000003",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Embarking on a journey to Al Minya, an ancient city cradled by the Nile in Upper Egypt, is an experience teeming with possibilities. Whether you seek the rhythmic pace of a bus ride or the scenic views of a train journey, Al Minya is well-connected and accessible."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000005",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "1) By Bus: A Road Journey to Remember "
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000a",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "uvh7w5t70pue",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "One of the most popular ways to reach Al Minya is by bus. The Upper Egypt Bus Station, situated on Sharia Saad Zaghloul, operates frequent services to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "gg7ek70terar",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "c3cjkvncgq2k"
       ],
       "text": "Cairo"
      },
      {
       "_key": "3ww3796ivd6h",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", with buses departing hourly starting from 6 am. The journey, a road "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000007"
       ],
       "text": "trip of approximately 4 hours"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", winds through the Egyptian landscape, offering glimpses of daily life and the country’s diverse terrain."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/sindbad-submarine-red-sea-tour-from-hurghada/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/sindbad-submarine-red-sea-tour-from-hurghada",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "c3cjkvncgq2k",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000c",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "2) By Train: A Glimpse of Egypt’s Rails"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000011",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For those who find romance in the rails, the train is an excellent choice. Al Minya’s train station, equipped with a tourist office (contactable at 234 2044), can provide valuable journey information. Trains to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000e"
       ],
       "text": "Cairo"
      },
      {
       "_key": "uit0tpc557xa",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", a blend of 1st- and 2nd-class comfort (priced at E£100/80), depart almost every 90 minutes, starting as early as 4.25 am. The journey lasts three to four hours, with the final train at 6.40 pm continuing towards "
      },
      {
       "_key": "vpsqylliclsb",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "53drkl1zrnwg"
       ],
       "text": "Alexandria"
      },
      {
       "_key": "uop4pgzouz20",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000e",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/cairo-travel-guide/coptic-cairo/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/guide/cairo/coptic-cairo",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "53drkl1zrnwg",
       "_type": "internalLink",
       "reference": {
        "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
        "_type": "reference"
       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000016",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000012",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For the nocturnal adventurers, southbound trains leave frequently, with the swiftest options departing between 11 pm and 1 am. For international travelers, the Wagons Lit trains from Cairo "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000014",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000013"
       ],
       "text": "offer a unique"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000015",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " experience, though reservations are recommended, particularly for couchettes – a service we can seamlessly arrange for you."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000013",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/nile-cruises/nour-el-nil-assouan-dahabiya",
       "newTab": false
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000021",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000017",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For those with "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000019",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000018"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " in their sights, seven 1st and 2nd class trains complete the six to eight-hour journey daily. A journey to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001b"
       ],
       "text": "Aswan"
      },
      {
       "_key": "qdxsxpvum7rf",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", traversing "
      },
      {
       "_key": "4wqd49upiwvt",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "8ongd0ouzc0z"
       ],
       "text": "Asyut"
      },
      {
       "_key": "7bxbz82pxdqz",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", "
      },
      {
       "_key": "b3ap125ttg0q",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "xgln6nipb0cf"
       ],
       "text": "Sohag"
      },
      {
       "_key": "u850vkrejlbx",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", and "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001e"
       ],
       "text": "Qena"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", extends to eight to 11 hours, immersing travelers in the expansive Egyptian landscape."
      }
     ],
